      "summary": "Astra single-pass English team repair using12 exact-byte source pages personally visually read in solutions52 and bound to its checkpoint:2English question pages,8official key pages,2alternate question pages. Restores omitted original question-page ephemeris table, native nine solution sections, supplied cancellation marks, precise graph placement and clipped spacecraft/C labels. Original whole-problem ID retained; no independent model checker.",
      "sourceGaps": [
        "The supplied key gives complete primary solutions for G1.1–G1.9, but prints only the heading “Alternative solution in COM frame” without that alternative derivation."
      ],
      "sourceDiscrepancies": [
        "Printed G1.7 key repeats angleASB for both delta lambda1 and2, repeats arcsin(0.66755) for phi2 despite the stated 68.9199degree, and calls the encounter day 190 while G1.4 calls it 191.",
        "G1.7 prose selects June5/August14, but its substituted longitude 141.2007 and distance 5.45085 match August9 in the original table. Original key retained.",
        "BG and both English question sheets print July4 distance5.2933308160; the English key prints5.2933081600. Question sheets print July23 distance5.3906444770; the key prints5.390644477. Distinct printed values retained."
      ],
